---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About FCMOBILETOOLS"
  description="Learn about FCMOBILETOOLS, an independent FC Mobile fan resource with tools, live information, calculators, guides and community-focused updates."
>
  <main class="about-page">
    <section class="about-hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT / FCMOBILETOOLS</p>
          <h1>Built to make<br /><em>FC Mobile easier.</em></h1>
          <p class="lede">
            FCMOBILETOOLS is an independent FC Mobile fan resource focused on practical tools,
            live game information, calculators, guides, updates and useful analysis.
          </p>
        </div>

        <aside class="identity-card" aria-label="FCMOBILETOOLS identity">
          <div class="logo-frame">
            <img src="/assets/images/logo.png" alt="FCMOBILETOOLS" width="1774" height="887" />
          </div>
          <span class="card-kicker">INDEPENDENT FAN PROJECT</span>
          <h2>FC Mobile, without the noise.</h2>
          <p>
            The goal is simple: keep the information players actually need easy to find,
            understand and use.
          </p>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap about-body">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">WHAT WE DO</p>
        <h2>A practical home for players.</h2>
        <p>
          From team building to event information, FCMOBILETOOLS brings together small utilities
          and reference content that can be useful while playing FC Mobile.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature-card">
          <span>01 / TOOLS</span>
          <h3>Useful utilities</h3>
          <p>
            Calculators, planners and team-focused tools designed to answer specific questions
            without making the process harder than it needs to be.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card">
          <span>02 / LIVE</span>
          <h3>Current game information</h3>
          <p>
            Event details, redeem codes, season information and other time-sensitive resources
            are organized so players can check what matters quickly.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card">
          <span>03 / CONTENT</span>
          <h3>Guides and analysis</h3>
          <p>
            Articles cover updates, guides, reviews, analysis and FC Mobile topics with an
            emphasis on practical context rather than filler.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="split-section">
        <article class="info-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">HOW WE HANDLE INFORMATION</p>
          <h2>Clear context matters.</h2>
          <p>
            FC Mobile information can change quickly. Where relevant, the site separates official
            information from community reports, leaks and other sources so readers can understand
            what is confirmed and what is still developing.
          </p>
          <p>
            We also welcome corrections when a page becomes outdated or contains an error.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="info-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">WHO BUILDS IT</p>
          <h2>TanzimFC</h2>
          <p>
            FCMOBILETOOLS is built and maintained under the TanzimFC project, with the aim of
            making FC Mobile resources more accessible and easier to use.
          </p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/creator/">Meet the creator ↗</a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <section class="independence">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">IMPORTANT</p>
          <h2>An independent fan-made website.</h2>
          <p>
            FCMOBILETOOLS is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or officially
            connected to EA SPORTS or Electronic Arts. FC Mobile and related names, trademarks
            and game assets belong to their respective owners.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a class="cta" href="/legal/contact">Contact us ↗</a>
      </section>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.about-page{background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden}
.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 28px));margin:auto}
.about-hero{
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 78% 12%,rgba(85,199,242,.17),transparent 32%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 8% 90%,rgba(85,199,242,.07),transparent 28%),
    linear-gradient(180deg,#07131b,#061018);
}
.hero-grid{
  min-height:570px;
  padding:78px 0;
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 390px;
  align-items:center;
  gap:82px;
}
.eyebrow{
  margin:0;
  color:var(--blue);
  font:900 8px var(--mono);
  letter-spacing:.16em;
}
.hero-copy h1{
  margin:18px 0 22px;
  font-size:clamp(58px,8vw,96px);
  line-height:.88;
  letter-spacing:-.078em;
}
.hero-copy h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}
.lede{
  max-width:670px;
  margin:0;
  color:#8fa3af;
  font-size:14px;
  line-height:1.85;
}
.identity-card{
  position:relative;
  padding:26px;
  border:1px solid #294454;
  border-radius:24px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0,rgba(85,199,242,.10),transparent 42%),
    linear-gradient(145deg,#0d1b24,#081118);
  box-shadow:0 30px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.55);
}
.logo-frame{
  display:grid;
  place-items:center;
  min-height:175px;
  padding:18px;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
  border-radius:18px;
  background:rgba(4,10,15,.42);
}
.logo-frame img{
  display:block;
  width:min(100%,270px);
  height:auto;
  object-fit:contain;
  filter:drop-shadow(0 12px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.35));
}
.card-kicker{
  display:block;
  margin-top:20px;
  color:#64808d;
  font:800 7px var(--mono);
  letter-spacing:.13em;
}
.identity-card h2{
  margin:7px 0 8px;
  font-size:27px;
  letter-spacing:-.05em;
}
.identity-card p{
  margin:0;
  color:#8297a3;
  font-size:11px;
  line-height:1.75;
}
.about-body{padding:82px 0 96px}
.section-intro{max-width:760px}
.section-intro h2{
  margin:8px 0 12px;
  font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,54px);
  line-height:1;
  letter-spacing:-.06em;
}
.section-intro>p:last-child{
  margin:0;
  color:#8297a3;
  font-size:12px;
  line-height:1.8;
}
.feature-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:13px;
  margin-top:30px;
}
.feature-card,.info-card{
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:17px;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0b171f,#081118);
}
.feature-card{
  min-height:205px;
  padding:23px;
  transition:transform .18s ease,border-color .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease;
}
.feature-card:hover{
  transform:translateY(-3px);
  border-color:#2f5366;
  box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.26);
}
.feature-card>span{
  color:var(--blue);
  font:800 7px var(--mono);
  letter-spacing:.1em;
}
.feature-card h3{
  margin:26px 0 8px;
  font-size:20px;
  letter-spacing:-.035em;
}
.feature-card p{
  margin:0;
  color:#7f949f;
  font-size:11px;
  line-height:1.75;
}
.split-section{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;
  gap:13px;
  margin-top:13px;
}
.info-card{padding:25px}
.info-card h2{
  margin:8px 0 11px;
  font-size:27px;
  letter-spacing:-.05em;
}
.info-card p{
  margin:0 0 12px;
  color:#7f949f;
  font-size:11px;
  line-height:1.8;
}
.text-link{
  display:inline-flex;
  margin-top:4px;
  color:#91e0ff;
  text-decoration:none;
  font:800 8px var(--mono);
}
.text-link:hover{color:#fff}
.independence{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:end;
  gap:28px;
  margin-top:48px;
  padding:27px;
  border:1px solid #2a4c5d;
  border-radius:19px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 0 0,rgba(85,199,242,.10),transparent 42%),
    #09141c;
}
.independence h2{
  margin:8px 0 9px;
  font-size:28px;
  letter-spacing:-.05em;
}
.independence p:last-child{
  max-width:790px;
  margin:0;
  color:#8195a0;
  font-size:10.5px;
  line-height:1.8;
}
.cta{
  display:inline-flex;
  flex:0 0 auto;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  padding:11px 14px;
  border:1px solid rgba(85,199,242,.32);
  border-radius:10px;
  background:rgba(85,199,242,.08);
  color:#99e4ff;
  text-decoration:none;
  font:900 7px var(--mono);
  transition:transform .18s ease,border-color .18s ease,background .18s ease;
}
.cta:hover{
  transform:translateY(-2px);
  border-color:rgba(85,199,242,.58);
  background:rgba(85,199,242,.12);
}
@media(max-width:900px){
  .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:60px 0;gap:34px}
  .identity-card{max-width:520px}
  .feature-grid,.split-section{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
@media(max-width:560px){
  .wrap{width:calc(100% - 24px)}
  .about-body{padding:62px 0 78px}
  .hero-copy h1{font-size:47px}
  .lede{font-size:13px}
  .feature-grid{gap:10px}
  .feature-card{min-height:0}
  .independence{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;padding:22px}
  .independence h2{font-size:24px}
  .cta{width:100%}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .feature-card,.cta{transition:none}
}
</style>
